  "remarks": "GV Gold is a Russian gold mining company, which is ranked among the top 10 gold mining companies in the Russian Federation. It operates multiple goldmines in Russia. The export of precious metals is one of the most significant sources of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. As of 2025, Russia is the second largest gold producing country in the world. Therefore, GV Gold is involved in economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
